                  "content": "What a researcher sees when they open the exported file. Direction A from 06b with light and dark themes: every color is a lab-* variable with a value per mode, so one layout serves both. The header carries a Light / Dark / System switch; System follows the viewer's OS setting. The recorded prototype is shown exactly as captured. Supersedes 06 and the other 06b options.",
